  - The production export in [38;5;153mscripts/export_prod.py[39m is now unverified against [38;5;153mreports.example.com[39m. The comment in
    [38;5;153mclient.py[39m records that, so it's visible to whoever reads the file next rather than buried in the diff.

  If you later want staging fixed without prod carrying the change, the [38;5;153mREPORTS_CA_BUNDLE[39m approach is a small follow-up
  — [38;5;153mverify=[39m takes a CA bundle path, so it's the same two call sites.

